1235	 * git's markers are `<<<<<<< label` and `>>>>>>> label` at the start of a line, and they
1236	 * are gone exactly when the conflict has been decided. A resolved path needs to be
1237	 * bracketed by git's end of it; a path written down as a literal, in a comment or a
1238	 * test, does not.
